{
  "name": "Email Approval Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "request-approval",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Webhook - Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.approverEmail }}",
        "subject": "Approval Required: {{ $json.body.requestTitle }}",
        "message": "Hi {{ $json.body.approverName }},\n\nA new approval request has been submitted:\n\n- **Request:** {{ $json.body.requestTitle }}\n- **Requested By:** {{ $json.body.requesterName }}\n- **Details:** {{ $json.body.details }}\n- **Amount:** {{ $json.body.amount || 'N/A' }}\n\nPlease click one of the links below:\n\n✅ **Approve:** {{ $json.body.webhookBaseUrl }}/webhook/approval-response?requestId={{ $json.body.requestId }}&decision=approved\n\n❌ **Reject:** {{ $json.body.webhookBaseUrl }}/webhook/approval-response?requestId={{ $json.body.requestId }}&decision=rejected\n\nThank you.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail to Approver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "values": [
              { "column": "requestId", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Request').item.json.body.requestId }}" },
              { "column": "requestTitle", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Request').item.json.body.requestTitle }}" },
              { "column": "requesterName", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Request').item.json.body.requesterName }}" },
              { "column": "requesterEmail", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Request').item.json.body.requesterEmail }}" },
              { "column": "approverEmail", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Request').item.json.body.approverEmail }}" },
              { "column": "status", "value": "pending" },
              { "column": "requestedAt", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Sheets Log Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [750, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "approval-response",
        "options": {},
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "name": "Webhook - Approval Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [250, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "values": [
              { "column": "requestId", "value": "={{ $json.query.requestId }}" },
              { "column": "status", "value": "={{ $json.query.decision }}" },
              { "column": "decidedAt", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "columnToMatchOn": "requestId"
        }
      },
      "name": "Update Sheets Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [500, 600],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "filters": {
          "column": "requestId",
          "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Approval Response').item.json.query.requestId }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read Request Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [750, 600],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.requesterEmail }}",
        "subject": "Your request '{{ $json.requestTitle }}' has been {{ $('Webhook - Approval Response').item.json.query.decision }}",
        "message": "Hi {{ $json.requesterName }},\n\nYour approval request has been processed:\n\n- **Request:** {{ $json.requestTitle }}\n- **Decision:** {{ $('Webhook - Approval Response').item.json.query.decision }}\n- **Decided At:** {{ $now.toISO() }}\n\nThank you.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail Notify Requester",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1000, 600],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "=Thank you! The request has been {{ $('Webhook - Approval Response').item.json.query.decision }}.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Respond to Approver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1250, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email Approval Workflow\n\nTwo-webhook system for email-based approval flows.\n\n**Request Flow (top):**\n1. Webhook receives approval request\n2. Gmail sends approval email with approve/reject links\n3. Log request to Sheets (status: pending)\n\n**Response Flow (bottom):**\n4. Approver clicks approve/reject link → second webhook\n5. Update Sheets status\n6. Read request details\n7. Gmail notifies requester of decision\n8. Respond to approver with confirmation\n\n**Request payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"requestId\": \"REQ-001\",\n  \"requestTitle\": \"Budget Increase\",\n  \"requesterName\": \"John\",\n  \"requesterEmail\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"approverName\": \"Manager\",\n  \"approverEmail\": \"manager@example.com\",\n  \"details\": \"Need $5000 for...\",\n  \"amount\": \"$5000\",\n  \"webhookBaseUrl\": \"https://your-n8n.com\"\n}\n```",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 460
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, -170]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - Request": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gmail to Approver",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gmail to Approver": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sheets Log Request",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook - Approval Response": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Sheets Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Update Sheets Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Request Details",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Request Details": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gmail Notify Requester",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gmail Notify Requester": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond to Approver",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}